1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,560
(Sheldon:)No, of course not.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,560
(Amy:)I trained Ricky how to smoke.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,030
(Amy:)I can train him
to shoot a poison dart.

4
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:08,360
(Amy:)No jury would convict us
'cause people love monkeys.

5
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,200
(Sheldon:)I understand

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,440
(Sheldon:)the alcohol has stirred up
whatever it is

7
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:15,500
(Sheldon:)that makes girls go wild...

8
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:19,470
(Sheldon:)but I really need to talk
to smart Amy now.

9
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:22,540
(Amy:)Excuse me.

10
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,180
(Amy:)Have you considered
that your intelligence

11
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:29,430
(Amy:)might be the very thing
causing your dilemma?

12
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,420
(Sheldon:)No.

13
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:36,730
(Amy:)What do you think Ricky
over here would do

14
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:39,360
(Amy:)if an interloper
encroached on his territory?

15
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:44,200
(Sheldon:)Well, when challenged, monkeys
generally assert their dominance

16
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:49,600
(Sheldon:)through chasing, assault
and a stylized penile display.

17
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:52,040
(Sheldon:)That's a little outside
my comfort zone.

18
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,540
(Amy:)You're being too literal.

19
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:56,880
(Amy:)My point is, he would not meekly
surrender to the rules,

20
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,610
(Amy:)and neither should you.

21
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:01,550
(Sheldon:)Are you suggesting I play dirty?

